    49	FreeSurfer and Cortical Parcellations. T1 images from each dataset were processed using FreeSurfer, version 6.0.1 (105). Regional estimates of each cortical measure were extracted based on the Desikan-Killiany atlas (106). For computational ef /uniFB01 ciency and because BrainChart models for separate hemispheres were not available at the time of analysis, measures were averaged across hemispheres for each parcellation.

